    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2c8fcb2a0043457eac42b6794458772e",
      "statement": "ProofSource separates fleet proofs (arbitrated by the follower ensemble, so no ownership re-read is needed) from bucket proofs (which must verify the ownership record still names this node at this epoch before acknowledging), and DurableReached carries the position actually proven so a partial proof cannot force an early ack.",
      "evidence": [
        {
