    {
      "id": "claim_ac5e070c86c243c39274db2f70699150",
      "statement": "Security/parsing fences are pure predicates in the core: the cell-scope charset gate in logic/cell is a path-traversal fence for the data directory and bucket prefix, the http authority gate protects request.url construction, and the peer identity/clock-window predicates guard signature verification.",
