      "id": "claim_cbf3a7557c5c4c50910e24308144310d",
      "statement": "Each logic module owns one decision family and names its executor in crates/celld: WakeCore reconciles bucket wake entries with a shared key scheme, log_tier/log_evict decide node-log ensemble membership against the CAS-guarded log/<node>.json record, drain governs the advisory fleet drain token, and isolate decides pool growth/shrink and placement performed by pool.rs.",
